":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2026-04-14T03:20:29Z","updated_at":"2026-04-14T05:31:35Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in 4.7.dev [0b3dc97], 4.6.stable.\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.stable - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Direct3D 12 (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060 Laptop GPU (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.9174) - 12th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-12700H (20 threads) - 15.69 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nNot sure if this is intended, but it is weird that `abs(_k)` is marked as unsafe code without a corresponding warning message.\n\nUsually, unsafe code is followed by a warning message explaining why that line is unsafe. In this case, it might be missing an \"Unsafe Cast\" warning.\n\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nPaste the following code into the GDScript editor:\n```gdscript\nextends Node\n\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tvar _k: float = 4.0\n\tvar _n1: float = abs(1.0)\n\tvar _n2: float = abs(_k) # <-- unsafe code; no warnings.\n\tvar _n3: float = absf(_k)\n\tpass\n```\nAlso, enable all the warnings in \"Project Settings > GDScript\".\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118557/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118557/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"reopened","pinned_comment":null}